ref=\"/2026/10/29/world-bank-projects-3-4-growth-for-bangladesh-and-calls-for-banking-energy-and-revenue-reforms/\">World Bank update</a>, <a href=\"/2026/10/29/rohingya-response-the-2026-appeal-is-a-quarter-smaller-and-still-underfunded/\">Rohingya response funding</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Coming next</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Interactive dashboards on poverty, climate and disaster risk, humanitarian funding, food security, WASH, education, health, gender, migration, social protection and localisation.</p>\n\n\n",
