lock-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.thedailystar.net/news/bangladesh/news/dont-burden-climate-victims-debt-4325761\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Daily Star: Don't burden climate victims with debt, 17 November 2026</a></li>\n</ul>"
