anal work handles people living along the banks.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sources</h3>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bangladeshpost.net/posts/ecnec-approves-16-projects-involving-tk-33-298cr-175717\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bangladesh Post (BSS): ECNEC approves 16 projects involving Tk 33,298cr, 18 November 2026</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://today.thefinancialexpress.com.bd/last-page/tk-6922b-project-awaits-ecnec-seal-today-1794936382\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Financial Express: Tk 69.22b project awaits ECNEC seal today, 18 November 2026</a></li>\n</ul>"
